- DALI limits: max 64 short addresses (0-63), max 16 groups, max 16 scenes.
- 15-minute commissioning timer applies for addressing commands (259-270).
- Method: Discover -> Assign short addresses -> Resolve clashes -> Assign Groups -> Assign Scenes -> Verify.
- Clashes: Never leave duplicates, move to free address.
- Replacement: Install new gear -> Assign old short address explicitly -> Re-apply config -> Verify.
- Safety: Warn before broadcast commands, never commission on known wiring faults.
